<!--
  RUT_SweetlineTree_Items.xml                    SWEETLINE_WOOL_HARVEST_1

  The harvest arid_shrubland.md §4 "The sweetline trees" promised and never
  shipped: "Giants rub against them, so the bark snags shed giant-wool — a
  rare hanging harvest for whoever dares the traffic." RUT_SweetlineTree
  (RUT_AshkarrFlora_Plants.xml) previously only offered TreeBase's inherited
  wood harvest, which fells the tree — wrong for a named, ancient, unique
  landmark that roads follow. See items/SWEETLINE_WOOL_HARVEST_1.md for the
  full account.

  Shape follows the existing wool precedent on disk, RSW_WoolBantha
  (src/RimStarWars/SWBestiary/Defs/ThingDefs_Items/RSW_Bantha_Items.xml):
  ParentName="WoolBase", override only texPath/color/statBases/stuffProps,
  everything else (comps, thingCategories, stackLimit) inherited unchanged.

  Naming: 🔑 provisional. The giants themselves are unnamed
  (ARIDSHRUBLAND_SHIPPING_NAMES_1, awaiting the owner's pick from
  Transient/shrubland_name_drafts_2026-09-21.md) — this defName/label is
  built off "sweetline" (the tree's own already-shipped name) and the
  generic fiction term "giant-wool", never off a giant species name that
  does not exist yet, so it needs no rename once the giants are named.

  Art: none exists (checked infrastructure/artpipe/done/, _artsrc/,
  registry.jsonl and art_status.json by subject — no "wool"/"giant-wool"/
  "sweetline wool" hits; the only "giant*" art on disk is unrelated giant-
  fungus/flower plant renders). The Codex channel is quota-blocked until
  ~2026-09-26 — per SWEETLINE_WOOL_HARVEST_1's brief this pass does NOT file
  an artpipe job (pending/active/registry files are out of scope for this
  item) and does NOT touch the daemon. texPath below points at where the
  render will land, same convention already used twice in this mod
  (RUT_Fuzz, RUT_StaggerseedFruit) for art that is owed rather than in
  hand — it will read as missing until a job is filed and the daemon lands
  it after the reset.
-->
<Defs>

  <ThingDef ParentName="WoolBase">
    <defName>RUT_SweetlineWool</defName>
    <label>giant-wool</label>
    <description>Long, silver-grey hanks of wool, snagged and shed where the biome's giants have rubbed their flanks raw against a sweetline tree for longer than any settlement nearby has stood. Thick and oily with the animal that grew it — warmer than any sheared fleece, and taken only by whoever is willing to work in the giants' shadow.</description>
    <graphicData>
      <!-- Job not yet filed (Codex quota-blocked until ~2026-09-26) — see header. -->
      <texPath>Things/Item/Resource/RUT_SweetlineWool</texPath>
      <color>(196,193,186)</color>
    </graphicData>
    <statBases>
      <MarketValue>5.5</MarketValue>
      <StuffPower_Armor_Sharp>0.42</StuffPower_Armor_Sharp>
      <StuffPower_Armor_Heat>1.3</StuffPower_Armor_Heat>
      <StuffPower_Insulation_Cold>36</StuffPower_Insulation_Cold>
      <StuffPower_Insulation_Heat>14</StuffPower_Insulation_Heat>
    </statBases>
    <stuffProps>
      <color>(196,193,186)</color>
      <commonality>0.04</commonality>
    </stuffProps>
  </ThingDef>

</Defs>
